  "worked_solution": "The definition of $\\operatorname{sinh}\u2061x$ is \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sinh}\u2061x=\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{x}-{e}^{-x}).\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sinh}\u2061(-\\sqrt{2}) & =\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{(-\\sqrt{2})}-{e}^{-(-\\sqrt{2})}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{-\\sqrt{2}}-{e}^{\\sqrt{2}}).\\end{aligned}\n$$",
